---
import { Button, Collapse, Spoiler, Timeline } from 'astro-pure/user'
import PageLayout from '@/layouts/CommonPage.astro'

const headings = [
  { depth: 2, slug: 'about-me', text: '关于我' },
  { depth: 2, slug: 'journey', text: '经历' },
  { depth: 2, slug: 'hobbies', text: '兴趣爱好' },
  { depth: 2, slug: 'tools', text: '工具与技术栈' },
  { depth: 2, slug: 'social', text: '社交账号' },
  { depth: 2, slug: 'projects', text: '开源项目' },
  { depth: 2, slug: 'gossips', text: '碎碎念' }
]

const journeyEvents = [
  { date: '2022', content: '进入<strong>杭州师范大学</strong>，地理信息科学专业（GIS 开发、遥感智能识别、计算机视觉）' },
  { date: '2026.02', content: '浙江建投数字技术有限公司 · 前端开发实习' },
  { date: '2026.06', content: '本科毕业，开始二学位（数据科学与大数据技术）+ 考研' },
  { date: '现在', content: '学习 Go 后端 & Agent 方向' }
]
---

<PageLayout title='关于' {headings} comment>
  {/* about-me */}
  <section id='about-me'>
    <div class='flex items-center gap-4 not-prose'>
      <img
        src='/src/assets/touxiang.png'
        alt='晚风'
        class='size-20 rounded-full border object-cover'
      />
      <div>
        <h2 class='mb-1 text-2xl font-medium'>晚风</h2>
        <p class='text-muted-foreground'>全栈开发者 · 学生</p>
        <div class='mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5'>
          <span class='rounded-full bg-primary/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-primary'>GIS</span>
          <span class='rounded-full bg-primary/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-primary'>Go</span>
          <span class='rounded-full bg-primary/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-primary'>Agent</span>
          <span class='rounded-full bg-primary/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-primary'>Vue / React</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class='mt-4 text-sm italic text-muted-foreground'>
      每个优秀的人都有一段沉默的时光，那段时光是付出了很多努力，却得不到结果的日子，我们把它叫做扎根。
    </p>

    <h3 class='mt-8 mb-3 text-lg font-medium'>个人简介</h3>
    <p>
      我是晚风，杭州师范大学 2022 级地理信息科学专业，2026 届毕业生，目前二学位在读（考研ing）。
    </p>
    <p>
      专业方向是 GIS 开发，本科期间做过遥感智能识别、计算机视觉相关的研究。毕业前在浙江建投数字技术有限公司做过前端开发实习。目前在学习 Agent 相关的方向，同时对 Go 后端开发很感兴趣。
    </p>
    <p>
      写这个博客主要是为了记录日常的学习和生活，希望在技术之路上留下一些痕迹。
    </p>
    <p class='text-sm text-muted-foreground'>
      联系我：
      <a href='mailto:wanfeng572@gmail.com' class='text-primary hover:underline'>wanfeng572@gmail.com</a>
    </p>
  </section>

  {/* journey - timeline */}
  <h2 id='journey' class='mt-10'>经历</h2>
  <Timeline events={journeyEvents} />

  {/* hobbies */}
  <h2 id='hobbies' class='mt-10'>兴趣爱好</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>📷 摄影（想学）</li>
    <li>🎸 会弹点吉他，希望之后可以把吉他重新捡起来</li>
    <li>🏀 偶尔打篮球，但大三之后没体育课就很少运动了</li>
  </ul>

  {/* tools */}
  <h2 id='tools' class='mt-10'>工具与技术栈</h2>

  <div class='not-prose mt-4'>
    <img
      src='https://skillicons.dev/icons?i=vue,react,angular,go,java,nodejs,ts,js,docker,git,linux,vscode&theme=light'
      alt='Tech Stack'
      class='max-w-full'
      loading='lazy'
    />
  </div>

  <h3 class='mt-6 mb-2 text-base font-medium'>AI Coding 工具</h3>
  <div class='not-prose flex flex-wrap gap-2'>
    <span class='rounded-md border px-2.5 py-1 text-sm'>Codex</span>
    <span class='rounded-md border px-2.5 py-1 text-sm'>Claude Code</span>
    <span class='rounded-md border px-2.5 py-1 text-sm'>Qoder</span>
  </div>

  {/* social */}
  <h2 id='social' class='mt-10'>社交账号</h2>
  <div class='not-prose mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-3'>
    <a href='https://github.com/Wanfeng1028' target='_blank' rel='noopener'
      class='inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border px-4 py-1.5 text-sm transition-colors hover:bg-muted'>
      <svg class='size-4' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='currentColor'><path d='M12 0C5.37 0 0 5.37 0 12c0 5.31 3.435 9.795 8.205 11.385.6.105.825-.255.825-.57 0-.285-.015-1.23-.015-2.235-3.015.555-3.795-.735-4.035-1.41-.135-.345-.72-1.41-1.23-1.695-.42-.225-1.02-.78-.015-.795.945-.015 1.62.87 1.845 1.23 1.08 1.815 2.805 1.305 3.495.99.105-.78.42-1.305.765-1.605-2.67-.3-5.46-1.335-5.46-5.925 0-1.305.465-2.385 1.23-3.225-.12-.3-.54-1.53.12-3.18 0 0 1.005-.315 3.3 1.23.96-.27 1.98-.405 3-.405s2.04.135 3 .405c2.295-1.56 3.3-1.23 3.3-1.23.66 1.65.24 2.88.12 3.18.765.84 1.23 1.905 1.23 3.225 0 4.605-2.805 5.625-5.475 5.925.435.375.81 1.095.81 2.22 0 1.605-.015 2.895-.015 3.3 0 .315.225.69.825.57A12.02 12.02 0 0 0 24 12c0-6.63-5.37-12-12-12z'/></svg>
      GitHub
    </a>
    <a href='https://x.com/wanfeng987654' target='_blank' rel='noopener'
      class='inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border px-4 py-1.5 text-sm transition-colors hover:bg-muted'>
      <svg class='size-4' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='currentColor'><path d='M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z'/></svg>
      Twitter / X
    </a>
    <a href='https://www.instagram.com/wanfeng8802/' target='_blank' rel='noopener'
      class='inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border px-4 py-1.5 text-sm transition-colors hover:bg-muted'>
      <svg class='size-4' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='currentColor'><path d='M12 2.163c3.204 0 3.584.012 4.85.07 3.252.148 4.771 1.691 4.919 4.919.058 1.265.069 1.645.069 4.849 0 3.205-.012 3.584-.069 4.849-.149 3.225-1.664 4.771-4.919 4.919-1.266.058-1.644.07-4.85.07-3.204 0-3.584-.012-4.849-.07-3.26-.149-4.771-1.699-4.919-4.92-.058-1.265-.07-1.644-.07-4.849 0-3.204.013-3.583.07-4.849.149-3.227 1.664-4.771 4.919-4.919 1.266-.057 1.645-.069 4.849-.069zM12 0C8.741 0 8.333.014 7.053.072 2.695.272.273 2.69.073 7.052.014 8.333 0 8.741 0 12c0 3.259.014 3.668.072 4.948.2 4.358 2.618 6.78 6.98 6.98C8.333 23.986 8.741 24 12 24c3.259 0 3.668-.014 4.948-.072 4.354-.2 6.782-2.618 6.979-6.98.059-1.28.073-1.689.073-4.948 0-3.259-.014-3.667-.072-4.947-.196-4.354-2.617-6.78-6.979-6.98C15.668.014 15.259 0 12 0zm0 5.838a6.162 6.162 0 1 0 0 12.324 6.162 6.162 0 0 0 0-12.324zM12 16a4 4 0 1 1 0-8 4 4 0 0 1 0 8zm6.406-11.845a1.44 1.44 0 1 0 0 2.881 1.44 1.44 0 0 0 0-2.881z'/></svg>
      Instagram
    </a>
    <a href='mailto:wanfeng572@gmail.com'
      class='inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border px-4 py-1.5 text-sm transition-colors hover:bg-muted'>
      <svg class='size-4' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='2'><rect x='2' y='4' width='20' height='16' rx='2'/><path d='m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7'/></svg>
      Email
    </a>
  </div>

  <h3 class='mt-6 mb-2 text-base font-medium'>微信</h3>
  <img src='/src/assets/WeChat.jpg' alt='WeChat' class='size-32 rounded-lg border object-cover' />

  {/* projects */}
  <h2 id='projects' class='mt-10'>开源项目</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong><a href='https://github.com/Wanfeng1028/ParrotSoundReVue' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>ParrotSoundReVue</a></strong>
      —— 之前做的一个项目，去水了一个奖哈哈（轻点喷）
    </li>
  </ul>

  {/* gossips */}
  <h2 id='gossips' class='mt-10'>碎碎念</h2>
  <Collapse title='点击展开'>
    <p>双非毕业生好难找工作。</p>
    <p>二战考研确实太痛苦了，但有时候学到很晚又很爽。希望明年一战上岸吧，等考研结束之后可能会继续更新博客。</p>
  </Collapse>
</PageLayout>
